{
  "id": "RAW_0cc355a002",
  "title": "把 DeepSeek V4 塞进 Codex：3 毛钱能干啥",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODkzMzMwMQ==&mid=2650453141&idx=1&sn=383eba8f8ab34ceb59495f1e6d961012",
  "date": "2026-08-01 18:21:00",
  "author": "AINLP",
  "siteName": "AINLP",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>NLPer</span> <span>2026-08-01 18:21</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">江苏</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_db25f48.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>DeepSeek Code 啥时候出？</p>\n  <div data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" data-website=\"https://www.mdnice.com\" data-renderer-version=\"ainlp-signature-v14\" data-render-profile=\"ainlp_signature\" style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 12px 6px;background:#fafbfa;width:auto;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#24272b;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;text-align:justify;\">\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">赶在 7 月的最后一天，DeepSeek 发布了 V4 Flash 正式版 API，不过 V4-Pro 还要等等。不知道算不算巧合，前脚 OpenAI 刚刚大降价：<a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 107, 184);text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODkzMzMwMQ==&amp;mid=2650453102&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2230db6a250a3750bb61fb60e5129b26&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">OpenAI 突然降价：GPT-5.6 Luna 直降 80%</a>。</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.725\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_786fdc5.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果用的是 DeepSeek 官方 API，把模型名改成&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">deepseek-v4-flash</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;就能调用。新版本原生支持 Responses API，还专门写了一页 Codex 接入文档。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我以前充过 100 元，一直没怎么用。看到这页文档，正好把它接进 Codex，前后塞了两道真实的 GitHub 任务。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">先看账单</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一道真题刚跑完时，后台是 84 次请求、3,037,485 个 Token，扣了 0.21 元。下面两张截图就是当时截的。</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5694444444444444\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_4e5492f.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.40185185185185185\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_d15be8c.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">只修一个 Bug，我还没看够。所以第一题结束以后，又找了一条没有评论、没有关联 PR 的功能需求。两道题跑完，后台累计 4,356,361 个 Token，账单显示 0.31 元。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">另外接法没有想象中绕，给 Codex 增加一个 DeepSeek provider，核心配置就是这几行，不清楚的朋友可以直接看官方文档，有一键配置脚本：</span></p>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">model = \"deepseek-v4-flash\"</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">model_provider = \"deepseek\"</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">[model_providers.deepseek]</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">name = \"deepseek\"</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">base_url = \"<a href=\"https://api.deepseek.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.deepseek.com/</a>\"</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">wire_api = \"responses\"</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">env_key = \"DEEPSEEK_API_KEY\"</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">API Key 可以放在环境变量里，不写进配置文件。为了不碰日常使用的 Codex，我单独建了一个临时&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">CODEX_HOME</span></code><span leaf=\"\">，联网搜索、MCP、Apps 和多 Agent 全部关掉。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">V4 Flash 能做的只有三件事：读本地代码、跑命令、看测试日志。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一题，先修一个真 Bug</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">题目来自 mypy #21796。mypy 是 Python 生态里最常用的静态类型检查器之一，代码还没运行，它会先顺着类型标注挑错。</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6611111111111111\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_4e68e9e.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这条最新的 Issue 前一天刚开，0 条评论，也没有关联 PR。问题出在&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">--warn-redundant-casts</span></code><span leaf=\"\">：一段类型转换明明什么也没改变，mypy 却没有提醒。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最小复现长这样：</span></p>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">T = TypeVar(\"T\")</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">def identity(xs: list[T]) -&gt; list[T]:</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; return xs</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">def f(xs: list[int]) -&gt; list[int]:</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; reveal_type(identity(xs))</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; return cast(list[int], identity(xs))</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">cast()</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;像是程序员递给类型检查器的一张说明：请把这个结果当成&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">list[int]</span></code><span leaf=\"\">。可上一行已经推断出了&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">list[int]</span></code><span leaf=\"\">，这张说明完全多余，开启冗余检查后本该收到一条告警。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我给 V4 Flash 的只有 Issue、当前代码和验收要求。源码入口没告诉它，补丁更没有。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">小测试全绿，差点收工</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">V4 Flash 沿着调用链追到&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">mypy/checkexpr.py</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;里的&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">visit_cast_expr()</span></code><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">问题出在一份&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;上下文。mypy 检查 cast 内部表达式时，本意是不限制它的类型；碰到&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">identity(xs)</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;这样的泛型函数，</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;却提前参加了推断，把&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">T</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;带成了&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">原本的&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">list[int]</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;变成&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">list[Any]</span></code><span leaf=\"\">，mypy 自然不会再把这次 cast 看成完全相同。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">V4 Flash 第一刀切到了公共泛型推断入口：遇到这种&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;上下文就忽略。原始复现通过了，额外准备的扩大类型、缩小类型、嵌套泛型和 cast 到&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;也没有误报。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">屏幕上一片绿。我当时也觉得，这题大概结束了。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">第 2208 个测试不答应</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">接下来跑 mypy 更大的&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">testcheck</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;测试集。前 2207 个都过了，第 2208 个突然变红：</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.625\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_88d866f.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">FAILED testGenericDictWithOverload</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Expected: dict[Any, Any]</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Actual: &nbsp; dict[Never, Never]</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">1 failed, 2207 passed, 2 skipped, 1 xfailed</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这条失败和原 Issue 没有直接关系。第一版补丁碰了公共推断逻辑，顺手把另一个依赖&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;上下文的正常场景改坏了。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">只跑模型刚补的几条测试，它已经可以宣布完成。mypy 多年攒下来的旧测试没让它走。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">最后，补丁缩成一行</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">看到回归后，V4 Flash 没去改旧测试的答案。它重新检查影响范围，把第一版公共修改撤掉，只在&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">cast()</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;的入口动了一行：</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6527777777777778\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_6745cfa.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">- type_context=AnyType(TypeOfAny.special_form)</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">+ type_context=None</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这一次，原始 Issue 开始正常告警，其他类型转换没有跟着遭殃。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">主测试最终跑出：</span></p>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">8195 passed, 33 skipped, 7 xfailed</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">411 passed, 2 skipped</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型结束后，我又单独跑了 6 条隐藏用例。3 个应该告警的全部报出，另外 3 个扩大类型、缩小类型和 cast 到&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Any</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;的场景零误报，</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">git diff --check</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;也通过。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一题到这里才算收住。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">修完 Bug，又让它加个功能</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二题还是 mypy，不过这次不是哪里坏了。</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5064814814814815\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_075b87f.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Issue #21629 想给 JUnit 报告增加一种&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">per_diagnostic</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;格式。JUnit 报告就是 CI 里的成绩单，mypy 目前可以把所有错误合成一项，也可以按文件拆开。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">问题是，一个大文件里可能堆着几十条类型错误。新人打开 CI，只看见一整个文件红了，很难一条一条认领。新需求希望每条 error 和 note 都变成独立 testcase：</span></p>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">原来：3 条诊断 -&gt; 1 个失败项</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">现在：3 条诊断 -&gt; 3 个失败项</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Issue 正文只有两小段，没有接口设计，也没告诉它代码藏在哪里。我把原文交给 V4 Flash，要求兼容旧格式、补齐测试和用户文档，仍然不许联网。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">七个文件，四分五十一秒</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">V4 Flash 先跑了一遍旧版输出，确认两条错误确实被塞在同一个 testcase 里。接着顺着调用链把 7 个文件串了起来：</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_e7e6cf7.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <ul style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;padding:0 0 0 23px;color:#24272b;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:4px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">命令行参数接受&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">per_diagnostic</span></code><span leaf=\"\">；</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:4px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">INI 和 TOML 配置走同一套校验；</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:4px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">XML 生成器逐条拆分 error 和 note；</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:4px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">两处文档补上新格式；</span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:4px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;\">\n     <p><span leaf=\"\">测试覆盖多文件、引号、尖括号、</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">&amp;</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;和严重错误。</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Issue 没规定每个 testcase 叫什么。它没有用&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">error-1</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;这种编号糊弄，而是把完整诊断放进名字里。CI 列表一展开，文件、行号和错误内容都能看见；诊断里带双引号时，再按 XML 属性规则转义。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">从接题到交卷，用了 4 分 51 秒。相关单元测试 8/8 通过，真实命令行和配置文件入口都能生成可解析的 XML；我另外准备的 3 组隐藏验收也全部通过。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">更大的命令行套件跑出 119 passed、22 skipped。还有 4 条&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">--num-workers</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;用例因为隔离环境连不上本地 build worker 没能跑通，报错路径和 JUnit 改动无关。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这一题没有出现“第 2208 个测试”。模型第一版就把功能、配置、文档和测试一起交齐了。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">两道真题，最后花了三毛多</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一道真题结束时，后台实际显示 0.21 元。两道任务全部跑完后，总览变成 125 次请求、4,356,361 个 Token，账单显示 0.31 元。</span></p>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.4101851851851852\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_c16beea.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <figure style=\"margin:24px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <span leaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5768518518518518\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:2px;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260801130406_7fd1bd4.png\"></span>\n   </figure>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二道功能题记录了 1,294,031 个输入 Token，其中 1,269,120 个命中缓存；输出 24,845 个 Token，这一轮大约花了 1 毛钱。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">把两道真题和最开始的接线测试放在一起：</span></p>\n   <pre style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><code style=\"display:block;padding:13px 14px;background:#1f2328;color:#f0f3f6;border-radius:4px;font:14px/1.7 Consolas,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">输入 Token &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4,280,178</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">其中缓存命中 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4,197,888</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">输出 Token &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 76,183</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">输入 + 输出 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4,356,361</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">按明细计算 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;¥0.31</span></span></code></pre>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓存命中率约 98.1%。Agent 会反复读同一批源码、对话和日志，长任务的大部分输入都复用了缓存，四百多万 Token 才落在三毛多。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">最后</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">两条 Issue、各跑一次，排不了模型座次。这里测到的也是&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek-V4-Flash + Codex 工具链</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：Codex 负责上下文、工具调用和测试执行，结果不能全算在底层模型头上。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一题看的是读旧代码和控制补丁范围。V4 Flash 确实把手伸宽过一次，也被第 2208 个测试打了回来；好在它能自己撤掉过宽方案，最后收成一行。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二题换了一种活：面对一条只有两段话的需求，把公共接口、配置、实现、文档和测试一起补齐。它这次没有停在“代码能跑”，还替没写清楚的 testcase 命名做了决定。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">跑到最后，三毛钱已经不是我最在意的数字。第一题看它挨打以后会不会收手，第二题看它能不能把两段话一路做成完整功能。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最后说明一下，这只是我个人对&nbsp;</span><code style=\"padding:1px 4px;color:#1e6bb8;background:#eef4f8;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">deepseek-v4-flash</span></code><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;的一次测试，两份改动都没有提交给 mypy。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek V4 的性价比到底如何？这两天测试过的朋友可以说说，欢迎评论区讨论！</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:36px 8px 18px;padding:0;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#202428;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考链接</span></span></h2>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;margin:0 8px 24px;padding:0 0 0 22px;color:#1e6bb8;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek-V4-Flash 更新日志：<a href=\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/updates/\" target=\"_blank\">https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/updates/</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek 接入 Codex 文档：<a href=\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/agent_integrations/codex/\" target=\"_blank\">https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/agent_integrations/codex/</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek 模型与价格：<a href=\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/\" target=\"_blank\">https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">mypy Issue #21796：<a href=\"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/21796\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/21796</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">mypy Issue #21629：<a href=\"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/21629\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/21629</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">mypy GitHub 仓库：<a href=\"https://github.com/python/mypy\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/python/mypy</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div data-ainlp-template=\"footer\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24272b;letter-spacing:0;\">\n    <div data-ainlp-template=\"footer-about\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:0 8px 20px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24272b;text-align:left;letter-spacing:0;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">加群请添加微信(id：ainlp2)，备注工作/研究方向。</span></strong></p>\n     <p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"AINLP公众号关注二维码\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.40404040404040403\" data-w=\"990\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:14px auto 0;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260716144931_76c9062.jpeg\"></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "作者通过实践将 DeepSeek V4 Flash 集成到 Codex，测试解决两个真实 mypy GitHub Issue，详细记录模型性能、Token 消耗与成本，验证其在代码理解与功能实现中的实际效果。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "作者通过实践将 DeepSeek V4 Flash 集成到 Codex，测试解决两个真实 mypy GitHub Issue，详细记录模型性能、Token 消耗与成本，验证其在代码理解与功能实现中的实际效果。",
  "summary": "文章记录了作者使用 DeepSeek V4 Flash 模型通过 Codex 工具链解决两个 mypy GitHub Issue 的过程。首先通过模型定位 Bug 并修复，但因影响范围过大触发回归测试失败；最终通过调整代码上下文控制精度完成修复。第二个任务在未明确接口设计的情况下，自主完成 JUnit 报告格式扩展功能，包括配置参数、实现逻辑、文档补充与测试验证。全程实际 Token 消耗 4，356，361，账单 0.31 元，缓存命中率 98.1%。文章展示了模型在代码理解、工具调用与功能实现中的实践价值，但未提交代码至开源社区。",
